flowchart TB
    Tenant[Microsoft Entra tenant<br/>Identity boundary] --> Root[Root management group<br/>Top-level governance scope]
    Root --> Platform[Platform management group]
    Root --> LandingZones[Landing zones management group]
    Platform --> Identity[Identity subscription]
    Platform --> Connectivity[Connectivity subscription]
    Platform --> Management[Management subscription]
    LandingZones --> Prod[Production subscription]
    LandingZones --> NonProd[Non-production subscription]
    Identity --> IRG[Resource groups and Azure resources]
    Connectivity --> CRG[Resource groups and Azure resources]
    Management --> MRG[Resource groups and Azure resources]
    Prod --> PRG[Resource groups and Azure resources]
    NonProd --> NRG[Resource groups and Azure resources]
